      "sample_posts": [
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "目前只有三家廠商符合 3.2T 光模組板要求：臻鼎（4958）、欣興（3037）、深南電路（002916）。  模組預計 2028 年開始出貨。 板材線寬／線距要到 10–15 微米，製程可能從 mSAP 升級到更複雜的 SAP，且供應商需具備 FC-BGA 載板產能。  華通等更多廠商能做 mSAP（約 12–25 微米）。1.6T 已用 mSAP 與 M8",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2107423119212249424",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-06T18:50:00.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 160
        },
        {
          "handle": "tphuang",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "He is a good follow. We don't get nearly enough industry commentary on X about what's actually going on w/ PCB & advanced packaging supply chain.  I read the mainland side on WeChat, but TW suppliers & EMS are very prominent for US hyperscaler build out.",
          "url": "https://x.com/tphuang/status/2107523665986527260",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-07T01:29:32.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 60
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "- AI 時代上游 CCL單靠市占或技術領先，並不保證能拿到訂單。 - 真正能搶到配額的條件是：技術、交期、銷售執行、PCB 廠回饋、客戶滿意度，五項都要到位。  - 目前最符合的是生益科技（Shengyi Technology），預期在輝達（NVDA）供應鏈的訂單占比會越來越重要。  - 台灣前四大 CCL",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2107467512770404839",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-06T21:46:24.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 59
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "早安！10/7 外電綜合整理  - 3189景碩: 亞系升目標 亞系券商將3Q-4Q26E 毛利率預估上調至 33.2-35.1%（～原為 28.9-30.3%），反映產品組合改善，包括 CPU 載板貢獻提高。其中高階晶片組載板的毛利率可能約為 50%，有助於推動整體毛利率擴張；也預估3Q的ABF/",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2107627203584536987",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-07T08:20:57.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 56
        },
        {
          "handle": "statementdog",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Only three PCB makers currently meet the requirements for 3.2T optical module boards, according to an industry source cited by DIGITIMES: Zhen Ding Tech (4958 TT), Unimicron (3037 TT) and Shennan Circuits (002916 CH).  The modules are expected to begin shipping in 2028. Their",
          "url": "https://x.com/statementdog/status/2107389346987065806",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-06T16:35:48.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 56
        },
        {
          "handle": "statementdog",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Daiwa expects prices for copper-clad laminate (CCL), the base material for AI server boards, to rise again in Q4 2026, with increases of about 10% for high-end grades and 20% for low-end grades.  Those hikes would follow increases of roughly 100% for low-end CCL and 40% to 50%",
          "url": "https://x.com/statementdog/status/2107535466824450427",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-07T02:16:26.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 31
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "BofA CCL for PCB  原料路徑：樹脂有分歧，玻布與銅箔較明確 CCL 三大原料是玻纖布、樹脂、銅箔。M4–M8 以 PPE/PPO 逐步取代 FR-4/環氧樹脂，M8 起碳氫樹脂（hydrocarbon）比重上升。進入 M9/M10，市場在 PTFE 與碳氫樹脂之間有分歧。  - 碳氫樹脂介電佳（Dk 約 2.2–2.6、Df 可至 0.001–0.005，高頻約",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2107722089230704836",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-07T14:38:00.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 26
        }
      ]
